WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.330
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:02.600 --> 00:06.000
National Radio and Television Administration

3
01:25.000 --> 01:30.000
Welcome to Sister Pang's Bathhouse

4
01:41.280 --> 01:41.880
Busy?

5
01:41.960 --> 01:42.820
Can't you tell?

6
01:43.000 --> 01:45.320
My keyboard is sparking. I'm busy.

7
01:45.800 --> 01:47.360
Well, I want to ask you something.

8
01:47.360 --> 01:48.000
Shoot.

9
01:48.080 --> 01:49.360
I have a relative

10
01:49.360 --> 01:51.680
who bought our company's 180,000-yuan wealth management product.

11
01:51.680 --> 01:54.210
I was wondering if he could withdraw it early.

12
01:57.000 --> 01:59.200
No, he needs the money urgently.

13
01:59.200 --> 02:00.520
If not, he can give up the interest.

14
02:00.520 --> 02:02.080
It's not about the interest.

15
02:02.080 --> 02:04.040
You can't just withdraw the principal either.

16
02:04.040 --> 02:04.880
He's really in a hurry.

17
02:04.880 --> 02:06.200
Can you think of a way?

18
02:06.200 --> 02:07.000
I can't.

19
02:07.280 --> 02:08.400
The head office just issued a policy.

20
02:08.400 --> 02:10.130
A three-month lock-in period.

21
02:10.199 --> 02:11.520
Policies are rigid.

22
02:11.520 --> 02:13.520
But people are flexible, right?

23
02:21.000 --> 02:21.720
You're doing this to me.

24
02:21.720 --> 02:22.320
No.

25
02:22.320 --> 02:23.120
Am I that kind of person?

26
02:23.120 --> 02:24.000
Definitely not.

27
02:24.000 --> 02:24.880
Don't do this to me.

28
02:24.880 --> 02:27.600
Brother Xin, we are close relatives.

29
02:27.600 --> 02:29.480
This is nothing. Come on.

30
02:31.760 --> 02:32.520
Is it expensive?

31
02:32.520 --> 02:35.360
Whether it's expensive or not, you deserve it.

32
02:36.079 --> 02:37.280
Just this once.

33
02:37.280 --> 02:38.680
Don't let anyone see you next time.

34
02:38.680 --> 02:40.200
Right. Help me think of a way.

35
02:40.200 --> 02:42.079
My relatives are not doing well financially.

36
02:42.079 --> 02:43.160
And you know...

37
02:43.480 --> 02:44.360
What do you mean? What are you doing?

38
02:44.360 --> 02:44.960
What's wrong?

39
02:44.960 --> 02:45.720
Slimming tea.

40
02:45.720 --> 02:47.079
Why do I need to lose weight? I'm not fat.

41
02:47.079 --> 02:47.720
That's not what I meant.

42
02:47.720 --> 02:48.600
Stop it. Take it all back.

43
02:48.600 --> 02:49.600
No, you take it.

44
02:49.600 --> 02:50.360
I don't want it. I won't lose weight.

45
02:50.360 --> 02:50.960
Take it.

46
02:50.960 --> 02:52.000
Don't, Lili.

47
02:54.360 --> 02:55.360
Help me out.

48
02:58.079 --> 02:59.120
Help you out?

49
02:59.400 --> 03:00.200
Somebody help!

50
03:00.200 --> 03:00.760
No.

51
03:00.760 --> 03:02.480
Indecent assault! Don't shout. Don't shout.

52
03:02.480 --> 03:02.800
Take it away.

53
03:02.800 --> 03:03.800
Okay, I'll take it away.

54
03:03.800 --> 03:05.080
Put the stool back.

55
03:05.800 --> 03:06.880
I'm leaving.

56
03:06.960 --> 03:08.020
Hurry up and leave.

57
03:08.960 --> 03:09.640
Bad luck.

58
03:15.360 --> 03:16.000
Director,

59
03:16.680 --> 03:18.440
the Shanyuan Bank case

60
03:18.440 --> 03:19.960
is similar to the several

61
03:19.960 --> 03:22.290
regular bank projects we've done before.

62
03:22.360 --> 03:23.400
And my team

63
03:23.400 --> 03:25.440
has rich experience

64
03:25.640 --> 03:27.000
in handling non-performing assets.

65
03:27.000 --> 03:28.800
But because of cross-border guarantees,

66
03:28.800 --> 03:29.880
Shanyuan was just fined 230 million.

67
03:29.880 --> 03:31.000
So I think

68
03:31.040 --> 03:33.480
we still need a team with crisis management experience.

69
03:33.480 --> 03:35.340
Experience is indeed important,

70
03:35.600 --> 03:37.880
including experience in communicating with clients.

71
03:37.880 --> 03:41.400
Lawyer Li must have a deep understanding of this.

72
03:42.120 --> 03:43.040
I do.

73
03:46.120 --> 03:46.680
Come in.

74
03:53.040 --> 03:53.760
Lawyer Qiu.

75
03:58.800 --> 03:59.600
Lawyer Qiu.

76
03:59.600 --> 04:00.400
Excuse me, Director Wang.

77
04:00.400 --> 04:02.800
I need to talk to Lawyer Li about something.

78
04:03.040 --> 04:04.480
You can just say it here.

79
04:06.200 --> 04:07.360
Feel free to speak.

80
04:07.480 --> 04:08.360
If it's about work,

81
04:08.360 --> 04:10.560
I have to report to the director anyway.

82
04:11.560 --> 04:12.240
Here's the thing.

83
04:12.240 --> 04:14.280
I tried my best to persuade Mr. Shao,

84
04:14.400 --> 04:16.120
and he agreed to give you another chance

85
04:16.120 --> 04:17.920
to continue working on the case.

86
04:19.079 --> 04:20.339
Thank you, Lawyer Qiu.

87
04:20.360 --> 04:21.720
But I have a lot of cases on hand right now,

88
04:21.720 --> 04:22.720
so I'm extremely busy.

89
04:22.720 --> 04:24.120
Since we've already terminated our contract,

90
04:24.120 --> 04:26.980
you'll have to take care of it yourself, Lawyer Qiu.

91
04:27.560 --> 04:29.280
Director, I think crisis management...

92
04:29.280 --> 04:30.040
Lawyer Li,

93
04:30.800 --> 04:32.280
This is an opportunity I fought hard

94
04:32.280 --> 04:34.480
to get from Mr. Shao.

95
04:34.480 --> 04:35.280
Then it's even more unnecessary.

96
04:35.280 --> 04:37.400
You can't force these things, right?

97
04:39.720 --> 04:41.120
No, no one is forcing you.

98
04:41.280 --> 04:45.280
Actually, Mr. Shao really wants to see you again.

99
04:45.480 --> 04:46.800
Just do me a favor

100
04:46.800 --> 04:48.360
and do it for my sake, okay?

101
04:51.400 --> 04:53.260
Since it's Mr. Shao's intention,

102
04:53.720 --> 04:56.480
you shouldn't have any concerns.

103
04:56.840 --> 04:57.560
Exactly.

104
04:57.720 --> 04:59.280
Shanyuan's matter isn't urgent.

105
04:59.280 --> 05:02.200
Let the lawyers on your team handle it first.

106
05:03.280 --> 05:04.120
Okay, Director.

107
05:04.120 --> 05:05.200
I understand.

108
05:06.280 --> 05:09.080
Then I'll trouble you, Lawyer Qiu, to call your...

109
05:09.640 --> 05:10.880
You didn't bring an assistant?

110
05:10.880 --> 05:12.360
Then I'll have to trouble you

111
05:12.360 --> 05:13.840
to arrange it yourself.

112
05:13.840 --> 05:15.680
Then we'll talk on the phone, okay?

113
05:15.680 --> 05:16.880
No problem, I'll arrange it.

114
05:16.880 --> 05:18.340
I'll leave you three to it.

115
05:18.480 --> 05:20.040
Okay, I'll call you then.

116
05:20.600 --> 05:21.600
Thanks for your trouble.

117
05:21.600 --> 05:22.720
My pleasure.

118
05:25.480 --> 05:27.480
How did you convince Shao Yinhai?

119
05:29.160 --> 05:31.090
It was Chairman Shao's own choice.

120
05:34.720 --> 05:36.320
Why not press your advantage

121
05:36.720 --> 05:37.650
and take the case

122
05:38.960 --> 05:40.880
completely into your own hands?

123
06:08.000 --> 06:09.400
Morning, Chairman Shao.

124
06:11.720 --> 06:13.720
You're a lot like me when I was young.

125
06:14.200 --> 06:15.480
You act decisively

126
06:15.880 --> 06:18.200
and speak right to the point.

127
06:22.040 --> 06:25.170
I assume you've noticed the problem too, Chairman Shao.

128
06:25.800 --> 06:27.200
I've been around for so many years.

129
06:27.200 --> 06:29.000
I've seen all kinds of monsters.

130
06:30.320 --> 06:32.960
I can tell who has real skills.

131
06:34.520 --> 06:35.600
Are you confident?

132
06:37.840 --> 06:40.000
Haven't you already chosen me?

133
06:46.240 --> 06:47.900
Then I'll trust you this time.

134
06:56.320 --> 06:57.000
Ms. Zhong.

135
06:59.520 --> 07:02.580
Lawyer Qiu, I'd like to have a word with Lawyer Li alone.

136
07:07.320 --> 07:08.160
Lawyer Li.

137
07:08.280 --> 07:10.720
Since Old Shao chose you, I trust you.

138
07:11.960 --> 07:14.720
Please do your best for him.

139
07:14.960 --> 07:16.240
Don't worry, Ms. Zhong.

140
07:16.240 --> 07:17.840
I will definitely do my best.

141
07:18.320 --> 07:21.780
Do you think we need to terminate the contract with Lawyer Qiu?

142
07:33.840 --> 07:34.320
Ms. Zhong.

143
07:34.320 --> 07:36.720
Actually, if you've already paid,

144
07:36.720 --> 07:37.920
it's fine to keep him.

145
07:38.080 --> 07:39.040
You don't mind?

146
07:40.040 --> 07:41.440
He's quite interesting.

147
07:41.720 --> 07:43.920
He's good at dealing with prosecutors.

148
07:43.920 --> 07:45.920
Keeping him around will be helpful.

149
07:47.400 --> 07:48.200
Alright then.

150
07:49.680 --> 07:51.610
I'll have him assist you properly.

151
07:55.600 --> 07:56.280
Everyone.

152
07:57.400 --> 07:58.520
Starting today,

153
07:59.800 --> 08:00.880
we are family.

154
08:01.360 --> 08:02.720
Starting today,

155
08:02.960 --> 08:05.800
every one of you will achieve success.

156
08:06.600 --> 08:07.530
Why do I say this?

157
08:08.480 --> 08:09.480
Because you have joined

158
08:09.480 --> 08:11.720
the Xinxin Jufu family.

159
08:11.920 --> 08:14.360
This choice itself is the best proof.

160
08:14.360 --> 08:17.680
This choice will also change your lives.

161
08:18.080 --> 08:21.000
Today you look up at me.

162
08:21.200 --> 08:22.000
Before long,

163
08:22.000 --> 08:24.600
more people will look up at you.

164
08:24.840 --> 08:27.880
Whether at home, at the company,

165
08:28.120 --> 08:29.360
or in society as a whole,

166
08:29.360 --> 08:31.960
your efforts deserve to be looked up to by everyone.

167
08:31.960 --> 08:34.360
Good, good, good!

168
08:46.200 --> 08:49.800
Xinxin Jufu makes a fortune! We're rich!

169
08:53.080 --> 08:54.680
How inspiring.

170
08:55.000 --> 08:57.440
That Huzi is our own brother.

171
08:57.440 --> 08:58.560
Guide him more in the future.

172
08:58.560 --> 08:59.840
Let's make money together.

173
08:59.840 --> 09:00.640
Nothing else.

174
09:00.800 --> 09:02.680
Just three words: use your heart.

175
09:02.680 --> 09:03.440
Use your heart. Use your heart.

176
09:03.440 --> 09:05.170
Brother Xin taught me all this.

177
09:05.480 --> 09:06.440
Shout the slogan.

178
09:06.440 --> 09:06.880
Come on.

179
09:06.880 --> 09:09.600
Xinxin Jufu, go, go, go!

180
09:09.800 --> 09:11.000
Starting today,

181
09:11.160 --> 09:13.000
you must keep an eye on him 24 hours a day.

182
09:13.000 --> 09:14.600
Whatever he does, you do.

183
09:16.440 --> 09:18.640
Let's see how he usually tricks people.

184
09:19.080 --> 09:21.800
Look at this child eating this every day. It's too plain.

185
09:21.800 --> 09:22.680
Here, you brought food again.

186
09:22.680 --> 09:23.440
Have you eaten?

187
09:23.440 --> 09:25.080
Don't worry about me. I've already eaten.

188
09:25.080 --> 09:25.680
Thank you.

189
09:26.360 --> 09:27.890
You bring me food every day.

190
09:32.080 --> 09:33.540
Come, let's eat together.

191
09:33.880 --> 09:34.760
Huzi, eat this.

192
09:37.640 --> 09:39.400
She cares about you this much.

193
09:39.800 --> 09:41.260
Is it hard to get her to pay?

194
09:41.280 --> 09:42.840
Weaving beautiful dreams for them

195
09:42.840 --> 09:44.520
and exploiting their sympathy

196
09:44.520 --> 09:46.850
is the best way to make people believe you.

197
09:48.400 --> 09:50.360
You need to master their deceptive routines

198
09:50.360 --> 09:51.560
and fully collect evidence.

199
09:51.560 --> 09:52.160
Come here.

200
09:53.240 --> 09:54.280
Huzi, come here for a second.

201
09:54.280 --> 09:55.610
As for these old people,

202
09:56.080 --> 09:57.960
many of their children are not around.

203
09:57.960 --> 09:59.800
What they lack most is care.

204
09:59.800 --> 10:01.160
You just break their defenses using this, you know?

205
10:01.160 --> 10:02.240
Break their defenses.

206
10:02.240 --> 10:03.640
Moms and dads, who is thirsty?

207
10:03.640 --> 10:04.840
Come here and have a drink.

208
10:04.840 --> 10:05.560
And also...

209
10:05.640 --> 10:07.440
You need to keep an eye on his private life

210
10:07.440 --> 10:09.520
and see how he interacts with the opposite sex.

211
10:09.520 --> 10:12.960
In short, completely infiltrate his social circle.

212
10:12.960 --> 10:13.440
Li,

213
10:14.640 --> 10:17.040
your love line and career line

214
10:17.280 --> 10:18.840
are deeply intertwined.

215
10:18.840 --> 10:19.520
What does that mean?

216
10:19.520 --> 10:20.320
It means

217
10:20.320 --> 10:23.120
your Mr. Right and your work

218
10:23.120 --> 10:25.720
are very closely connected.

219
10:25.720 --> 10:27.240
See this dotted line here?

220
10:27.240 --> 10:28.200
The one extending out.

221
10:28.200 --> 10:30.880
Often, the deeper it's hidden, the more real it is.

222
10:30.880 --> 10:31.880
That's not a palm line.

223
10:31.880 --> 10:33.040
It's a scar from when I fell as a kid.

224
10:33.040 --> 10:35.000
Fate made you fall.

225
10:35.000 --> 10:36.040
Really.

226
10:36.160 --> 10:38.560
Fate let you meet your Mr. Right.

227
10:38.960 --> 10:39.490
You know?

228
10:39.640 --> 10:40.240
Fate.

229
10:44.120 --> 10:45.160
I told you so.

230
10:45.160 --> 10:47.520
Lawyer Qiu is just a show-off.

231
10:47.520 --> 10:48.720
Unlike our Lawyer Li,

232
10:48.920 --> 10:51.200
who used his exceptional skills and personal charm

233
10:51.200 --> 10:52.460
to win over the client.

234
10:52.600 --> 10:53.960
I really learned a lot this time.

235
10:53.960 --> 10:55.160
I learned a lot too.

236
10:55.440 --> 10:57.120
We finally vented our frustration.

237
10:57.120 --> 10:58.440
It's truly satisfying.

238
10:58.440 --> 10:59.960
Don't celebrate too early.

239
10:59.960 --> 11:02.080
For the crime of organizing and leading a mafia-style organization,

240
11:02.080 --> 11:03.520
apart from the ones the client pleaded guilty to,

241
11:03.520 --> 11:04.520
namely the first three charges,

242
11:04.520 --> 11:06.800
we need to find enough strong evidence

243
11:06.800 --> 11:08.280
to beat the remaining four charges

244
11:08.280 --> 11:10.040
so we can clear the major charge of gang involvement.

245
11:10.040 --> 11:10.720
Understood?

246
11:10.720 --> 11:11.440
Copy that.

247
11:16.280 --> 11:17.720
Lanya will handle the intentional property damage.

248
11:17.720 --> 11:18.760
Follow this list

249
11:18.760 --> 11:19.720
and visit

250
11:20.040 --> 11:21.360
the people who worked in the mine back then.

251
11:21.360 --> 11:22.000
Ask around

252
11:22.000 --> 11:23.680
to find out the actual reason

253
11:23.680 --> 11:25.680
why they smashed the cars back then.

254
11:25.840 --> 11:28.080
Ding Chao, you're quite sharp with documents.

255
11:28.080 --> 11:29.400
You'll handle the illegal land occupation.

256
11:29.400 --> 11:30.640
Pay special attention to it.

257
11:30.640 --> 11:33.040
Whether the actual damage to the woodland over the years

258
11:33.040 --> 11:35.570
matches the results of the appraisal report.

259
11:35.760 --> 11:37.800
Bowen, you're in charge of the illegal detention.

260
11:37.800 --> 11:39.880
Time the route from the crime scene to the hospital

261
11:39.880 --> 11:42.160
and see if it matches the time of detention

262
11:42.160 --> 11:43.920
mentioned in the victim's statement.

263
11:43.920 --> 11:46.320
Verify the authenticity of the statement.

264
11:51.720 --> 11:52.040
Lawyer Li.

265
11:52.040 --> 11:52.840
That was fast.

266
11:52.960 --> 11:54.240
I was just thinking about getting a bite to eat.

267
11:54.240 --> 11:54.800
Yeah.

268
11:55.120 --> 11:57.280
It only takes over an hour from the crime scene to the hospital.

269
11:57.280 --> 11:57.920
That means

270
11:57.920 --> 12:00.240
the victim was detained for at least four hours,

271
12:00.240 --> 12:01.760
which perfectly matches the statement.

272
12:01.760 --> 12:03.600
It'll be hard to overturn this charge.

273
12:03.600 --> 12:05.000
Did you take the highway?

274
12:05.160 --> 12:06.690
I followed the navigation.

275
12:08.320 --> 12:09.380
Get in. I'll drive.

276
12:37.360 --> 12:37.960
Open it.

277
12:55.720 --> 12:56.440
Lawyer Li,

278
12:57.160 --> 12:58.090
you're amazing.

279
12:58.960 --> 13:01.360
I really didn't learn the trick

280
13:03.320 --> 13:05.120
about the highway opening time.

281
13:16.400 --> 13:20.560
On the Paoma Mountain,

282
13:20.560 --> 13:24.680
there is a cloud.

283
13:24.720 --> 13:28.600
It shines brightly

284
13:28.720 --> 13:32.720
on the city of Kangding.

285
13:32.960 --> 13:39.000
The crescent moon,

286
13:39.160 --> 13:42.200
shines on the city of Kangding.

287
13:42.200 --> 13:43.530
Get out. Get out of here.

288
13:48.880 --> 13:49.400
Okay.

289
13:49.400 --> 13:52.680
Come on. Xinxin Jufu,

290
13:52.760 --> 13:53.960
get rich.

291
13:54.880 --> 13:55.360
Cheers.

292
13:55.960 --> 13:56.600
Come on.

293
13:56.600 --> 13:58.720
Get rich. Get rich. Get rich.

294
14:00.400 --> 14:02.080
Come here. Brother Huan, come here.

295
14:02.080 --> 14:02.760
What are you doing? Come on.

296
14:02.760 --> 14:03.620
Lili, sit down.

297
14:05.920 --> 14:07.640
I have to offer you a toast.

298
14:07.840 --> 14:08.960
I have no education

299
14:08.960 --> 14:09.960
and no skills,

300
14:09.960 --> 14:10.880
but I just want to get rich.

301
14:10.880 --> 14:12.240
I think you dance pretty well.

302
14:12.240 --> 14:13.200
That's nothing.

303
14:13.200 --> 14:14.800
If I hadn't met Brother Xin and you,

304
14:14.800 --> 14:15.800
I would be doomed.

305
14:15.800 --> 14:16.400
During this time,

306
14:16.400 --> 14:17.920
I've learned a lot from you.

307
14:17.920 --> 14:19.080
You're being too polite.

308
14:19.080 --> 14:20.280
Brother Xin's brother is my brother.

309
14:20.280 --> 14:20.560
Come on.

310
14:20.560 --> 14:22.040
Absolutely. We three are like Liu, Guan, and Zhang.

311
14:22.040 --> 14:23.240
Absolutely. Come on.

312
14:25.200 --> 14:26.920
Work hard with your brother from now on.

313
14:26.920 --> 14:29.920
Just like I said, divide and conquer, you know?

314
14:29.920 --> 14:31.200
I must conquer them.

315
14:31.200 --> 14:32.200
I'll conquer them with all my might.

316
14:32.200 --> 14:34.130
You have to conquer them one by one.

317
14:38.640 --> 14:39.800
Who is it? What are you doing?

318
14:39.800 --> 14:41.920
Don't shout. What are you shouting for?

319
14:41.920 --> 14:42.800
Who is it?

320
14:46.360 --> 14:46.800
What's wrong?

321
14:46.800 --> 14:48.640
Leyang's Eight Great Guardians. I'm Xiao Jun.

322
14:48.640 --> 14:49.240
Do you know me?

323
14:49.240 --> 14:50.120
Jun... Brother Jun.

324
14:50.120 --> 14:50.840
Li Guochen.

325
14:50.840 --> 14:53.480
Former Deputy Chief of Fengxiang Street Police Station.

326
14:53.480 --> 14:54.120
Brother Chief.

327
14:54.120 --> 14:54.800
What do you mean, Brother Chief?

328
14:54.800 --> 14:55.040
No.

329
14:55.040 --> 14:56.800
What kind of combination is this, you two old men?

330
14:56.800 --> 14:58.360
We're here for the talent show as a group.

331
14:58.360 --> 14:59.760
We're the Eagle Catching Chicken group.

332
14:59.760 --> 15:00.920
No, don't waste your breath on him.

333
15:00.920 --> 15:01.720
Let me ask you.

334
15:01.720 --> 15:03.160
Did you hit on my daughter?

335
15:03.160 --> 15:04.640
Who is your daughter?

336
15:04.640 --> 15:05.440
Xiao Longnv.

337
15:06.440 --> 15:07.760
You're Xiao Longnv's father?

338
15:07.760 --> 15:09.040
No, no, no.

339
15:09.160 --> 15:10.240
What do you mean I hit on her?

340
15:10.240 --> 15:11.000
Are you trying to deny it?

341
15:11.000 --> 15:12.520
I can't just admit to everything.

342
15:12.520 --> 15:13.600
How... How could I hit on her?

343
15:13.600 --> 15:14.520
I wouldn't hit on her even if you beat me to death.

344
15:14.520 --> 15:15.400
Are you saying my daughter isn't good enough for you?

345
15:15.400 --> 15:16.400
She... She is good enough.

346
15:16.400 --> 15:17.120
More than good enough.

347
15:17.120 --> 15:17.720
Telling the truth now, huh?

348
15:17.720 --> 15:18.640
What truth? You...

349
15:18.640 --> 15:19.520
When did you fall for her?

350
15:19.520 --> 15:20.840
You two are confusing me.

351
15:20.840 --> 15:22.700
We've been watching you for days.

352
15:22.960 --> 15:24.640
We know everything about you.

353
15:24.640 --> 15:24.840
No, that's...

354
15:24.840 --> 15:26.120
You'd better be honest.

355
15:26.120 --> 15:27.120
You were at the wealth management company,

356
15:27.120 --> 15:28.280
then you became a scammer,

357
15:28.280 --> 15:29.280
scamming ordinary people's money.

358
15:29.280 --> 15:29.640
Are you scamming people?

359
15:29.640 --> 15:30.800
This is confirmed, right?

360
15:30.800 --> 15:31.360
Confirmed what?

361
15:31.360 --> 15:32.720
We have all the evidence now.

362
15:32.720 --> 15:35.040
Leniency for those who confess, severity for those who resist.

363
15:35.040 --> 15:36.600
What severity are you talking about?

364
15:36.600 --> 15:37.400
This is a misunderstanding.

365
15:37.400 --> 15:38.400
Misunderstanding about what?

366
15:38.400 --> 15:39.520
Don't get physical.

367
15:39.520 --> 15:41.600
I... I went undercover.

368
15:41.600 --> 15:42.840
Your daughter asked me to.

369
15:42.840 --> 15:44.680
She's working on a case and investigating someone,

370
15:44.680 --> 15:46.480
so she asked me to go undercover.

371
15:46.600 --> 15:48.600
No, your line of work has undercover agents too?

372
15:48.600 --> 15:50.460
Well, it was his daughter's idea.

373
15:50.480 --> 15:51.360
Xiaolong asked you to?

374
15:51.360 --> 15:53.220
If you don't believe me, call her.

375
15:53.240 --> 15:54.300
What? Undercover?

376
15:56.960 --> 15:58.680
Did you get it all wrong?

377
15:59.920 --> 16:00.800
No, just... no.

378
16:01.280 --> 16:02.840
Even if my daughter asked you to go undercover,

379
16:02.840 --> 16:04.080
you can't keep a secret at all.

380
16:04.080 --> 16:04.880
Not at all.

381
16:05.000 --> 16:06.280
Why are you so self-righteous, Huzi?

382
16:06.280 --> 16:06.640
Everything...

383
16:06.640 --> 16:07.360
Huzi.

384
16:08.520 --> 16:09.680
Uncle, Uncle.

385
16:10.520 --> 16:11.720
How come we meet here?

386
16:12.160 --> 16:13.280
I've been waiting for you for a long time.

387
16:13.280 --> 16:14.440
My uncles.

388
16:14.440 --> 16:14.920
Uncle.

389
16:15.400 --> 16:16.860
Here, take this and drink.

390
16:16.960 --> 16:17.520
Take it and drink.

391
16:17.520 --> 16:19.280
You're too kind. I'll get you another case.

392
16:19.280 --> 16:20.840
No need. You guys go ahead.

393
16:20.840 --> 16:22.000
We'll drink a little longer.

394
16:22.000 --> 16:23.000
Go ahead.

395
16:23.280 --> 16:23.960
I'll head back then.

396
16:23.960 --> 16:24.640
Okay.

397
16:25.040 --> 16:25.680
Enjoy your drink.

398
16:25.680 --> 16:26.600
Go home early.

399
16:26.760 --> 16:27.400
There's more.

400
16:27.400 --> 16:28.480
No need, no need.

401
16:28.480 --> 16:28.960
Are you okay?

402
16:28.960 --> 16:29.720
I'm fine.

403
16:29.720 --> 16:30.880
Old people's lives are boring,

404
16:30.880 --> 16:31.840
so we come out to have some fun.

405
16:31.840 --> 16:32.840
Let's just drink.

406
16:34.520 --> 16:37.400
You drink. Next time, make sure you get it right

407
16:37.400 --> 16:38.730
before calling me over.

408
16:39.400 --> 16:41.600
Why is Xiaolong playing spy games?

409
16:47.920 --> 16:50.320
You just took two bottles of beer from them.

410
16:51.640 --> 16:53.960
You have to pay for them at the front desk later.

411
16:53.960 --> 16:55.720
You can't just take people's things.

412
16:55.720 --> 16:56.640
You know?

413
16:59.400 --> 17:00.660
Who am I doing this for?

414
17:07.480 --> 17:08.240
Drink some water.

415
17:08.240 --> 17:10.099
I'm not drinking it. Put it there.

416
17:12.040 --> 17:15.560
Xiao Jun, I don't want to get mad at you today.

417
17:15.680 --> 17:16.599
I just want to ask you.

418
17:16.599 --> 17:17.930
What were you thinking?

419
17:17.960 --> 17:19.599
Why did you have to go and make a mess?

420
17:19.599 --> 17:21.440
You almost ruined my case.

421
17:21.440 --> 17:22.480
No, how was I supposed to know?

422
17:22.480 --> 17:24.560
I thought you were dating that little punk.

423
17:24.560 --> 17:25.200
You should have told me earlier.

424
17:25.200 --> 17:26.319
Then this wouldn't have happened.

425
17:26.319 --> 17:28.440
Why would I tell you about something that didn't happen?

426
17:28.440 --> 17:30.440
Fine, consider this a wake-up call.

427
17:30.440 --> 17:31.080
What does it mean?

428
17:31.080 --> 17:32.360
It means when you look for a boyfriend in the future,

429
17:32.360 --> 17:33.040
someone like that guy

430
17:33.040 --> 17:34.920
is definitely below the bottom line.

431
17:34.920 --> 17:35.840
Absolutely not.

432
17:35.840 --> 17:36.520
Absolutely not.

433
17:36.520 --> 17:37.680
Now you're talking about bottom lines.

434
17:37.680 --> 17:39.680
Then let me ask you. What's your upper limit?

435
17:39.680 --> 17:40.640
Let me hear it.

436
17:41.360 --> 17:42.440
Well...

437
17:42.840 --> 17:44.200
Someone like Xin.

438
17:44.360 --> 17:45.040
Li Xin?

439
17:45.040 --> 17:45.680
Yes.

440
17:46.160 --> 17:47.280
We're not compatible.

441
17:47.280 --> 17:48.360
How can you not be compatible?

442
17:48.360 --> 17:49.280
You're the same age.

443
17:49.280 --> 17:51.440
Our horoscopes clash. Our personalities clash.

444
17:51.440 --> 17:52.680
We clash in every way.

445
17:54.960 --> 17:55.600
Lawyer Li.

446
17:56.000 --> 17:57.600
If you sneeze,

447
17:57.600 --> 17:59.600
it means someone is thinking of you.

448
18:01.120 --> 18:02.050
Let's continue.

449
18:02.520 --> 18:04.320
I visited a few workers from back then.

450
18:04.320 --> 18:07.200
They all said the mine guard team

451
18:07.200 --> 18:09.200
wanted to prevent Chen from stealing in the mining area,

452
18:09.200 --> 18:10.320
so they damaged his car.

453
18:10.320 --> 18:11.360
It wasn't intentional property destruction.

454
18:11.360 --> 18:13.200
Look for relevant documents about the mine guard team

455
18:13.200 --> 18:14.960
to see if there's any policy support.

456
18:14.960 --> 18:15.560
Okay.

457
18:15.560 --> 18:17.360
Boss, in the appraisal report submitted by the prosecution

458
18:17.360 --> 18:19.080
regarding the illegal land occupation,

459
18:19.080 --> 18:20.720
I found a minor error in the details.

460
18:20.720 --> 18:21.920
It only lists

461
18:21.920 --> 18:23.600
the data and photos after the forest land was damaged,

462
18:23.600 --> 18:25.400
but none from before the damage.

463
18:25.480 --> 18:28.640
But wouldn't this seem a bit like nitpicking?

464
18:28.840 --> 18:30.120
No, this is very good.

465
18:30.440 --> 18:31.700
In judicial practice,

466
18:31.840 --> 18:32.920
claiming damage to the subject matter

467
18:32.920 --> 18:35.400
requires presenting both the original and damaged states

468
18:35.400 --> 18:37.080
to form a complete chain of evidence.

469
18:37.080 --> 18:38.520
Don't be afraid to find flaws.

470
18:38.520 --> 18:39.640
The prosecution's mistakes

471
18:39.640 --> 18:41.500
are our best breakthrough point.

472
18:41.800 --> 18:44.440
Then we're only left with intentional injury.

473
18:47.080 --> 18:49.440
This is the surveillance footage from the time of the incident.

474
18:49.440 --> 18:50.840
Shao Yinhai's demolition site

475
18:50.840 --> 18:52.280
was blocked by the residents.

476
18:52.280 --> 18:54.760
His subordinate Ma Benteng was ordered to the scene to settle the matter

477
18:54.760 --> 18:56.640
and beat up the homeowner, Yu.

478
18:56.760 --> 18:58.480
He ended up hitting him too hard

479
18:58.480 --> 18:59.560
and beat the man to death.

480
18:59.560 --> 19:00.560
Ma Benteng fled the scene immediately

481
19:00.560 --> 19:02.320
and was only recently apprehended.

482
19:02.320 --> 19:03.280
He confessed

483
19:03.560 --> 19:05.690
that he was instigated by Shao Yinhai.

484
19:05.920 --> 19:08.650
Therefore, the prosecution charged Shao Yinhai

485
19:08.720 --> 19:10.560
with instigating intentional injury.

486
19:10.560 --> 19:13.200
That means we just need to prove

487
19:13.280 --> 19:15.160
that the instigation charge doesn't hold.

488
19:15.160 --> 19:16.280
It's not that easy.

489
19:16.320 --> 19:17.840
Ma Benteng said before he made his move,

490
19:17.840 --> 19:19.440
he spoke to Shao Yinhai on the phone.

491
19:19.440 --> 19:21.770
Shao Yinhai explicitly said on the phone,

492
19:22.160 --> 19:24.420
"Beat him up and teach him a good lesson."

493
19:24.520 --> 19:26.120
The service provider also provided the call logs,

494
19:26.120 --> 19:27.920
which match the timeline

495
19:27.920 --> 19:28.840
of Ma Benteng's assault.

496
19:28.840 --> 19:30.160
Then that is instigation.

497
19:30.160 --> 19:32.020
What does Shao Yinhai have to say?

498
19:33.640 --> 19:34.370
He denied it.

499
19:35.520 --> 19:36.680
He's talking nonsense.

500
19:36.680 --> 19:38.360
I never said that at all.

501
19:38.600 --> 19:40.920
Do you remember exactly what was said on the phone?

502
19:40.920 --> 19:41.720
I just remember

503
19:41.720 --> 19:43.120
Ma Benteng called me and said

504
19:43.120 --> 19:44.440
something happened at the scene,

505
19:44.440 --> 19:45.640
like someone died.

506
19:45.800 --> 19:47.060
So I told him to go hide.

507
19:48.240 --> 19:48.880
Lawyer Li.

508
19:49.000 --> 19:51.480
Do you think Shao Yinhai denied it on purpose

509
19:51.480 --> 19:52.600
to get away with it?

510
20:01.320 --> 20:02.450
The video in the file

511
20:02.600 --> 20:05.400
only covers an hour before and after the incident.

512
20:16.680 --> 20:19.280
Write an application to the procuratorate to obtain evidence.

513
20:19.280 --> 20:20.740
I need the complete video.

514
20:21.600 --> 20:22.120
Okay?

515
20:22.280 --> 20:22.760
Okay.

516
20:24.760 --> 20:26.690
The complete surveillance video?

517
20:26.720 --> 20:27.800
Is that necessary?

518
20:27.960 --> 20:28.720
We're handling a case.

519
20:28.720 --> 20:30.180
It's better to be careful.

520
20:30.760 --> 20:32.080
So, what do you think?

521
20:33.880 --> 20:35.440
You're Chief Li's son.

522
20:37.880 --> 20:39.160
You know my father?

523
20:39.800 --> 20:41.200
When I was at the station,

524
20:41.440 --> 20:42.560
your dad told me

525
20:43.360 --> 20:45.360
your childhood dream was to be a cop.

526
20:47.240 --> 20:47.680
Yes.

527
20:47.680 --> 20:49.560
What, you didn't become a cop,

528
20:49.880 --> 20:52.410
so now you stand against the judicial system?

529
20:56.560 --> 20:57.200
Prosecutor Liu,

530
20:57.200 --> 21:00.260
you transferred from a police officer to a prosecutor.

531
21:00.360 --> 21:01.120
You didn't use connections.

532
21:01.120 --> 21:02.850
You passed the bar exam, right?

533
21:03.200 --> 21:04.360
Then don't say things

534
21:04.360 --> 21:05.560
that make it seem like the procuratorate's

535
21:05.560 --> 21:07.160
legal system is inadequate.

536
21:08.840 --> 21:10.240
Can you approve it or not?

537
21:16.720 --> 21:17.400
Thank you.

538
21:19.480 --> 21:20.680
Nothing better to do.

539
21:26.360 --> 21:27.560
The door is unlocked.

540
21:34.160 --> 21:35.560
Dad, why did you call me over

541
21:35.560 --> 21:36.080
in such a hurry?

542
21:36.080 --> 21:37.080
Li Xin, sit down.

543
21:45.040 --> 21:48.120
Old Liu is my former colleague after all.

544
21:48.720 --> 21:50.400
What's wrong with him saying a few words to you?

545
21:50.400 --> 21:52.260
Look at how you talked back to him.

546
21:52.480 --> 21:54.640
Why do you have no sense of propriety when you speak?

547
21:54.640 --> 21:55.840
Was I out of line?

548
21:55.920 --> 21:57.840
He said I was the enemy of the judicial system.

549
21:57.840 --> 22:00.840
You're taking Shao Yinhai's case.

550
22:01.480 --> 22:03.360
Just to help him clear his name, aren't you?

551
22:03.360 --> 22:04.200
If you help him get away with it,

552
22:04.200 --> 22:06.040
how much money can you make, Li Xin?

553
22:06.040 --> 22:07.770
I can indeed make a lot of money.

554
22:07.800 --> 22:09.560
You're making dirty money.

555
22:09.680 --> 22:11.320
Do you know that your dirty money

556
22:11.320 --> 22:13.080
makes me unable to hold my head up

557
22:13.080 --> 22:14.280
in front of all my comrades in the system?

558
22:14.280 --> 22:16.920
I'm making a complete fool of myself.

559
22:16.920 --> 22:18.560
You care too much about what others think.

560
22:18.560 --> 22:19.640
Of course I care.

561
22:19.640 --> 22:20.840
Because I'm a cop.

562
22:21.400 --> 22:22.840
And you're a cop's son.

563
22:22.960 --> 22:25.640
Dressed in a suit, looking all proper.

564
22:25.640 --> 22:27.100
Did you study law back then

565
22:27.320 --> 22:29.980
just to help bad guys get away with their crimes?

566
22:34.640 --> 22:37.560
Dad, making you lose face in front of your old colleagues

567
22:37.560 --> 22:38.600
is my fault.

568
22:39.440 --> 22:40.160
I'm sorry.

569
22:43.480 --> 22:46.400
But I have to fight this case.

570
22:48.360 --> 22:49.320
I'll get going.

571
23:17.280 --> 23:19.400
There aren't as many orders lately.

572
23:19.600 --> 23:20.280
Just wait.

573
23:20.800 --> 23:22.720
Lili is working on a big order.

574
23:23.320 --> 23:24.520
You always have a way.

575
23:25.320 --> 23:26.380
Come have some tea.

576
23:26.480 --> 23:27.280
Thanks, Xin.

577
23:28.000 --> 23:28.520
Xin.

578
23:29.440 --> 23:31.600
That Huzi you introduced to me last time,

579
23:31.600 --> 23:33.400
he has high EQ.

580
23:33.520 --> 23:34.600
He knows a lot of people

581
23:34.600 --> 23:35.680
and helped me a lot.

582
23:36.280 --> 23:37.610
What's his background?

583
23:37.680 --> 23:39.340
What background does he have?

584
23:39.520 --> 23:41.520
His family used to run a public bathhouse.

585
23:41.520 --> 23:43.760
He started hanging out early and knows how to deal with things.

586
23:43.760 --> 23:45.240
He's just smart.

587
24:27.440 --> 24:28.440
Hu, you're back.

588
24:29.520 --> 24:30.440
What have you been busy with lately?

589
24:30.440 --> 24:32.040
I've been really busy lately.

590
24:32.040 --> 24:33.080
Your new haircut looks handsome.

591
24:33.080 --> 24:34.720
Really? Hasn't it always been like this?

592
24:34.720 --> 24:36.250
More handsome than before.

593
24:37.520 --> 24:38.520
Huzi is back.

594
24:38.720 --> 24:39.720
Have some fruit.

595
24:59.920 --> 25:00.920
This is my car.

596
25:01.480 --> 25:02.760
Let me sit for a while.

597
25:02.800 --> 25:04.800
I'll charge you if you keep sitting.

598
25:07.760 --> 25:08.480
Huzi,

599
25:09.600 --> 25:11.260
come help Mom move some stuff.

600
25:18.320 --> 25:19.920
What are you thinking about? Stop dawdling.

601
25:19.920 --> 25:20.840
Huzi is back.

602
25:21.120 --> 25:22.320
Have you had breakfast?

603
25:22.320 --> 25:22.880
Hu,

604
25:23.000 --> 25:24.080
your mom is calling you.

605
25:24.080 --> 25:24.840
Hu.

606
25:25.560 --> 25:26.280
Huzi,

607
25:26.640 --> 25:29.400
why are you dawdling? Did you hear me?

608
25:29.880 --> 25:31.040
Dong Beihu,

609
25:31.840 --> 25:33.320
what are you thinking about?

610
25:33.320 --> 25:34.800
Dong Beihu, I finally caught you.

611
25:34.800 --> 25:36.200
Don't run. Just you wait.

612
25:39.400 --> 25:41.200
I was waiting for you.

613
25:42.800 --> 25:43.720
You bastard.

614
25:43.720 --> 25:45.120
I'll fight you to the death today.

615
25:45.120 --> 25:45.760
Let's talk this out.

616
25:45.760 --> 25:47.360
Did you mortgage my law firm?

617
25:48.720 --> 25:49.080
Yes.

618
25:49.080 --> 25:49.720
I need money.

619
25:49.720 --> 25:50.720
Who told you to occupy my second floor?

620
25:50.720 --> 25:52.320
It's perfectly legal for me to rent here.

621
25:52.320 --> 25:54.520
This is my house. I can do whatever I want.

622
25:54.520 --> 25:55.560
I'll call the police on you.

623
25:55.560 --> 25:56.840
Did you smash my door?

624
25:56.840 --> 25:57.720
What evidence do you have?

625
25:57.720 --> 25:58.280
Don't talk nonsense.

626
25:58.280 --> 25:58.880
I think

627
25:58.880 --> 26:00.040
you'll have to go back to jail.

628
26:00.040 --> 26:00.840
Go call the police.

629
26:00.840 --> 26:02.520
I will call the police on you, you hooligan.

630
26:02.520 --> 26:03.640
I'm a hooligan? Right,

631
26:03.640 --> 26:04.840
I am a hooligan.

632
26:05.280 --> 26:06.280
Hooligan.

633
26:06.280 --> 26:08.080
You look like a chainsaw.

634
26:08.080 --> 26:08.680
Like a mop.

635
26:08.680 --> 26:10.140
I'm carrying out justice.

636
26:10.400 --> 26:11.640
Look at them every day,

637
26:11.640 --> 26:12.560
it's endless.

638
26:12.960 --> 26:15.480
It hasn't been peaceful since Xiao Longnv came.

639
26:15.480 --> 26:16.800
One is a dragon and the other is a tiger.

640
26:16.800 --> 26:18.040
Of course they'll fight.

641
26:18.040 --> 26:19.040
Everyone saw it.

642
26:19.160 --> 26:20.160
She hit me first.

643
26:32.440 --> 26:34.520
Can you stop pacing around?

644
26:34.520 --> 26:35.840
It's making me dizzy.

645
26:36.640 --> 26:37.600
Listen to me.

646
26:38.080 --> 26:39.720
I've analyzed it carefully,

647
26:39.840 --> 26:41.000
and I think this Lili

648
26:41.000 --> 26:42.720
is Zhou Huan's new target.

649
26:42.720 --> 26:44.520
She should be our breakthrough.

650
26:44.520 --> 26:45.480
You need to work on her.

651
26:45.480 --> 26:46.280
I'm not going.

652
26:46.480 --> 26:46.800
Let me tell you,

653
26:46.800 --> 26:47.880
I'm done with this job.

654
26:47.880 --> 26:49.560
Zhou Huan is already starting to suspect me.

655
26:49.560 --> 26:50.920
Brother Hu, why are you getting emotional?

656
26:50.920 --> 26:52.160
This is crucial.

657
26:52.160 --> 26:53.680
This is dangerous.

658
26:53.880 --> 26:54.640
Didn't you say

659
26:54.640 --> 26:56.000
if I gave you Zhou Huan's information,

660
26:56.000 --> 26:57.280
you'd get my money back?

661
26:57.280 --> 26:58.920
You also said you'd take down Jia Xin's whole gang.

662
26:58.920 --> 26:59.960
Calm down.

663
26:59.960 --> 27:01.400
We have to wait for the right moment.

664
27:01.400 --> 27:02.640
Stop waiting.

665
27:02.640 --> 27:04.680
Now is the best time. Make a move.

666
27:04.920 --> 27:06.720
If we don't move now, they'll all run away.

667
27:06.720 --> 27:08.200
Then we'll lose everything.

668
27:08.200 --> 27:09.600
Your target and my money.

669
27:09.680 --> 27:10.540
Let me tell you,

670
27:10.920 --> 27:12.640
if you don't come up with a new plan,

671
27:12.640 --> 27:14.160
I'll use my own.

672
27:14.160 --> 27:14.840
Come back.

673
27:16.320 --> 27:16.850
Sit down.

674
27:20.280 --> 27:22.560
I do have a new trick

675
27:22.560 --> 27:24.000
to take them all down.

676
27:24.000 --> 27:25.200
Do you want to hear it?

677
27:25.320 --> 27:26.480
Then tell me quickly.

678
27:26.480 --> 27:28.880
I've had enough of being treated like dirt.

679
27:28.960 --> 27:31.360
I'll go report to the economic crime investigation department first,

680
27:31.360 --> 27:32.560
and then you...

681
27:47.840 --> 27:49.840
Yu, order chicken frames for lunch.

682
28:02.360 --> 28:04.760
Making coffee, Lili? Let me make it for you.

683
28:04.880 --> 28:07.140
Are you trying to make coffee or hit on me?

684
28:07.880 --> 28:10.520
I was thinking of making you some instant noodles.

685
28:10.520 --> 28:11.000
Hu.

686
28:11.000 --> 28:13.720
I've figured it out recently.

687
28:13.720 --> 28:14.720
You're always sticking to me

688
28:14.720 --> 28:15.920
and keeping such a close eye on me.

689
28:15.920 --> 28:17.280
What are you doing?

690
28:17.400 --> 28:18.930
I don't mean anything else.

691
28:19.160 --> 28:20.480
Good.

692
28:20.480 --> 28:22.520
You know about me and your Brother Huan,

693
28:22.520 --> 28:23.520
right?

694
28:23.520 --> 28:24.520
I know. It's easy to cause misunderstandings,

695
28:24.520 --> 28:25.480
and it's not good if rumors spread.

696
28:25.480 --> 28:28.240
I know. You're getting married to Brother Huan, right?

697
28:28.240 --> 28:29.570
Keep it a secret for now.

698
28:29.920 --> 28:32.050
I was just wondering why you chose him.

699
28:32.720 --> 28:33.800
What do you mean by that?

700
28:33.800 --> 28:34.680
Should I have chosen you instead?

701
28:34.680 --> 28:37.160
No, is it that unreasonable to choose me?

702
28:37.520 --> 28:38.720
What's wrong with me?

703
28:39.680 --> 28:41.520
He's better than you in every way.

704
28:41.520 --> 28:43.080
Just look at your Brother Huan's eyes.

705
28:43.080 --> 28:44.680
One of his is as big as three of yours.

706
28:44.680 --> 28:46.600
His eyelashes are like caterpillars.

707
28:46.600 --> 28:47.520
So pretty.

708
28:48.360 --> 28:49.880
Not to mention his looks,

709
28:50.680 --> 28:51.680
your Brother Huan

710
28:52.520 --> 28:53.960
is truly good to me.

711
28:54.160 --> 28:55.560
How does he show it?

712
28:55.640 --> 28:57.480
Did he buy you a house, a car,

713
28:57.480 --> 28:58.720
or a big diamond?

714
28:58.800 --> 28:59.880
Well, no.

715
28:59.880 --> 29:02.120
Then you're too easily satisfied.

716
29:02.880 --> 29:03.610
Look at this.

717
29:05.440 --> 29:07.240
What is this? A colorful string?

718
29:07.560 --> 29:09.000
One gram of gold.

719
29:09.200 --> 29:10.560
That's so tacky.

720
29:10.880 --> 29:13.000
Who buys that stuff nowadays?

721
29:16.000 --> 29:16.800
Take a look.

722
29:17.640 --> 29:18.300
Take a look.

723
29:18.400 --> 29:19.200
What is this?

724
29:21.240 --> 29:22.360
So many zeros.

725
29:23.400 --> 29:24.120
Don't tell anyone.

726
29:24.120 --> 29:25.040
How much is this?

727
29:25.040 --> 29:25.880
One million.

728
29:26.720 --> 29:28.000
What is this thing?

729
29:28.280 --> 29:29.540
Endowment insurance.

730
29:30.920 --> 29:32.650
Now you know why you can't do it.

731
29:33.240 --> 29:35.170
Because you don't have the vision.

732
29:35.320 --> 29:36.250
You little punk.

733
29:36.400 --> 29:38.730
Go learn. It's all yours once you learn it.

734
29:38.760 --> 29:39.240
Lili.

735
29:39.240 --> 29:40.640
Let me take one more look.

736
29:40.760 --> 29:41.600
Lawyer Xiao.

737
29:41.720 --> 29:43.680
Thank you for the clues you provided.

738
29:43.680 --> 29:45.720
We have already filed a case for investigation.

739
29:45.720 --> 29:46.880
That's great.

740
29:47.600 --> 29:49.520
Captain Zhai.

741
29:49.800 --> 29:50.960
Is it convenient to ask

742
29:50.960 --> 29:52.560
when we will make the arrest?

743
29:53.120 --> 29:56.120
I can't disclose that to you.

744
29:56.120 --> 29:57.400
Understood.

745
29:57.520 --> 29:58.280
The main thing is,

746
29:58.280 --> 30:00.960
I'm afraid Zhou Huan is too cunning.

747
30:00.960 --> 30:02.200
During the Anding Wealth Management incident,

748
30:02.200 --> 30:04.080
he got away right before it blew up.

749
30:04.080 --> 30:06.400
I'm afraid he'll run away again this time.

750
30:06.400 --> 30:07.200
Isn't that...

751
30:07.960 --> 30:08.920
This case

752
30:08.920 --> 30:10.920
involves more than just Zhou Huan.

753
30:11.520 --> 30:13.960
Acting rashly will alert the enemy.

754
30:14.920 --> 30:18.180
If we find the suspect transferring large amounts of funds

755
30:18.480 --> 30:20.960
or attempting to flee the country,

756
30:21.200 --> 30:22.800
only then can we take action.

757
30:26.040 --> 30:26.680
Yes.

758
30:27.840 --> 30:31.440
Brother Hu, you're going to make a great contribution this time.

759
30:36.280 --> 30:39.080
I already have. Look.

760
30:43.760 --> 30:44.920
Pretty impressive.

761
30:45.040 --> 30:46.770
Alright, get ready for action.

762
30:48.160 --> 30:49.440
This phone is good.

763
30:49.440 --> 30:51.200
It has a large battery capacity.

764
30:51.200 --> 30:52.160
Thanks, baby.

765
30:53.640 --> 30:54.440
Brother Huan.

766
30:54.720 --> 30:55.200
Huzi.

767
30:55.200 --> 30:56.000
Brother Huan.

768
30:56.160 --> 30:57.800
Are you free tonight? Let me treat you to dinner.

769
30:57.800 --> 30:58.560
No need to be so polite.

770
30:58.560 --> 30:59.760
I actually have plans tonight.

771
30:59.760 --> 31:00.640
No need to arrange anything.

772
31:00.640 --> 31:02.520
I've learned a lot from you over this time.

773
31:02.520 --> 31:03.680
Let me repay you a little.

774
31:03.680 --> 31:04.920
What, did you book it?

775
31:04.920 --> 31:06.440
It's booked. Ginseng chicken soup.

776
31:06.440 --> 31:09.400
You've been exhausted lately. Let's get you some nourishment.

777
31:09.400 --> 31:10.280
Okay, it's a deal.

778
31:10.280 --> 31:11.810
I'm your brother. My treat.

779
31:11.920 --> 31:13.200
You always do this.

780
31:13.200 --> 31:14.000
Wait a minute.

781
31:15.640 --> 31:16.120
Lili.

782
31:16.160 --> 31:17.400
I have some work at the company tonight.

783
31:17.400 --> 31:19.440
I'll be back late. Be good.

784
31:21.160 --> 31:21.880
Go, go.

785
31:21.880 --> 31:22.480
Let's drink.

786
31:22.480 --> 31:23.320
Let's drink.

787
31:26.880 --> 31:29.160
Huzi, why are you drinking so much?

788
31:29.560 --> 31:30.820
What's bothering you?

789
31:33.560 --> 31:34.720
I'm sorry.

790
31:35.320 --> 31:36.640
You treat me so well,

791
31:37.560 --> 31:39.280
but I'm hiding something from you.

792
31:39.280 --> 31:40.740
Hiding something from me?

793
31:40.840 --> 31:41.900
What is it? Tell me.

794
31:42.360 --> 31:43.600
I'm embarrassed.

795
31:46.880 --> 31:48.440
Is it about a woman?

796
31:49.760 --> 31:51.280
Bro, you're a psychic.

797
31:51.680 --> 31:53.200
You're so accurate.

798
31:53.200 --> 31:54.680
You can't hide anything from me.

799
31:54.680 --> 31:55.720
What is it? Tell me.

800
31:55.720 --> 31:57.640
Confess and I won't blame you.

801
32:00.000 --> 32:01.080
I like Lili.

802
32:03.360 --> 32:04.040
Who?

803
32:04.560 --> 32:05.120
Li?

804
32:05.640 --> 32:06.800
My Lili?

805
32:07.960 --> 32:10.360
Don't objectify women.

806
32:10.360 --> 32:12.720
Lili is her own Lili.

807
32:15.000 --> 32:16.800
Bro, I'm just envious,

808
32:17.040 --> 32:19.200
or even jealous.

809
32:19.600 --> 32:20.480
I just don't understand

810
32:20.480 --> 32:24.080
why Lili is so devoted to you.

811
32:27.480 --> 32:29.440
Huzi, I've had too much to drink.

812
32:30.920 --> 32:32.920
If you're talking about dating,

813
32:34.320 --> 32:36.560
it's just three words: use your heart.

814
32:37.600 --> 32:38.040
What are you doing?

815
32:38.040 --> 32:39.080
What are you doing?

816
32:39.080 --> 32:39.920
Sorry.

817
32:40.560 --> 32:41.490
Sorry, I choked.

818
32:42.200 --> 32:43.130
So you're saying

819
32:44.480 --> 32:45.720
you really love Lili?

820
32:45.720 --> 32:46.680
Of course.

821
32:46.680 --> 32:47.720
Let me tell you,

822
32:48.560 --> 32:50.920
from the first moment I saw Lili,

823
32:51.520 --> 32:52.480
I knew

824
32:52.920 --> 32:56.680
she was the one I've been waiting for,

825
32:56.680 --> 32:57.920
the right one.

826
32:58.920 --> 33:00.480
Then you should marry her.

827
33:00.480 --> 33:01.940
I won't marry anyone else.

828
33:02.360 --> 33:03.520
You have no chance.

829
33:03.800 --> 33:05.860
I will love her for the rest of my life.

830
33:10.520 --> 33:13.680
Why are you acting like a hopeless romantic?

831
33:14.240 --> 33:17.280
It makes me sick to hear that from you.

832
33:17.280 --> 33:18.440
It stinks.

833
33:20.120 --> 33:20.920
What?

834
33:21.560 --> 33:24.240
Upset? Hit me if you're upset.

835
33:25.280 --> 33:25.760
Come on.

836
33:31.520 --> 33:33.360
I'm not upset, Huzi.

837
33:33.800 --> 33:35.360
I'm telling the truth.

838
33:35.720 --> 33:37.520
Your world is too narrow.

839
33:37.680 --> 33:41.080
You're still young. I don't blame you for not understanding.

840
33:41.080 --> 33:42.340
You still need to grow.

841
33:42.480 --> 33:43.320
It's okay.

842
33:44.360 --> 33:48.000
What kind of broad-mindedness are you showing off?

843
33:48.000 --> 33:49.320
You use your heart?

844
33:49.760 --> 33:51.080
Your heart is

845
33:51.080 --> 33:53.600
coveting the pensions of old people.

846
33:53.800 --> 33:56.400
To put it bluntly, you're pure scum.

847
33:56.960 --> 33:58.800
You're absolutely wicked.

848
33:59.280 --> 34:00.120
You,

849
34:01.120 --> 34:03.040
you're the scum of society.

850
34:04.360 --> 34:06.080
What? Are you upset now?

851
34:06.240 --> 34:08.080
Come on, hit me. Come on.

852
34:12.000 --> 34:14.000
You're right, Huzi.

853
34:14.440 --> 34:16.320
I... I am indeed scum.

854
34:16.800 --> 34:17.360
No, bro.

855
34:17.360 --> 34:18.560
Let me tell you, Huzi,

856
34:19.080 --> 34:19.960
so many times,

857
34:20.960 --> 34:22.639
I slap myself at night.

858
34:22.639 --> 34:23.159
Don't... don't do that.

859
34:23.159 --> 34:23.840
I tell myself,

860
34:23.840 --> 34:25.800
can you change your way of living?

861
34:25.800 --> 34:26.639
Just change your way of living.

862
34:26.639 --> 34:27.760
Brother, you don't need to change. You're fine here.

863
34:27.760 --> 34:29.520
God didn't give me another way.

864
34:29.520 --> 34:30.400
I can only go this way.

865
34:30.400 --> 34:31.560
Yeah, blame God.

866
34:31.760 --> 34:33.290
Just look at my background.

867
34:33.880 --> 34:35.600
Is it that easy for me to make some money?

868
34:35.600 --> 34:36.760
It's too hard.

869
34:36.760 --> 34:38.520
I don't want it to be like this.

870
34:39.040 --> 34:39.880
What are you doing?

871
34:39.880 --> 34:41.239
Waiter, check please.

872
34:41.280 --> 34:42.120
I'll pay.

873
34:42.120 --> 34:43.080
Don't you dare take his money. Sit down.

874
34:43.080 --> 34:44.280
No, I'll pay. Aren't I your brother?

875
34:44.280 --> 34:45.139
You are, but...

876
34:47.280 --> 34:48.639
Brother, stop hitting me.

877
34:48.639 --> 34:49.719
Just showing off your money.

878
34:49.719 --> 34:53.179
You think it's glorious to scam money? You think you're great?

879
34:54.480 --> 34:56.600
What? Hitting me?

880
34:56.639 --> 34:58.920
You're drunk. I don't blame you.

881
34:58.920 --> 34:59.880
I didn't drink much.

882
34:59.880 --> 35:00.320
Come on, check please.

883
35:00.320 --> 35:01.040
No, don't.

884
35:01.040 --> 35:01.720
Waiter.

885
35:01.720 --> 35:02.440
What do you mean you're paying?

886
35:02.440 --> 35:03.400
Why are you so...

887
35:03.400 --> 35:04.200
Check please.

888
35:04.920 --> 35:06.080
Why are you so stubborn?

889
35:06.080 --> 35:07.840
Why are you so stubborn?

890
35:09.840 --> 35:10.440
Pro.

891
35:10.440 --> 35:11.680
Yes, pro.

892
35:13.640 --> 35:14.480
Shattered.

893
35:15.560 --> 35:16.960
It's brand new.

894
35:17.880 --> 35:19.140
I've waited all night.

895
35:19.280 --> 35:20.280
I've learned jiu-jitsu.

896
35:20.280 --> 35:21.600
Who do you think you're messing with?

897
35:21.600 --> 35:23.200
Hurry up and call the police.

898
35:27.320 --> 35:28.960
What are you doing? Don't move.

899
35:28.960 --> 35:29.620
Don't move.

900
35:29.720 --> 35:30.380
Don't move.

901
35:30.800 --> 35:31.460
Don't move.

902
35:33.160 --> 35:34.560
See that, officer? He still wants to hit me.

903
35:34.560 --> 35:35.440
So arrogant.

904
35:36.040 --> 35:37.320
Look how arrogant he is.

905
35:37.320 --> 35:38.640
He's famous in our area.

906
35:38.640 --> 35:40.840
He hits people after drinking a little.

907
35:41.000 --> 35:42.440
Listen to me, officer.

908
35:43.080 --> 35:45.080
I can't hold it anymore.

909
35:45.480 --> 35:47.010
I want to go to the bathroom.

910
36:00.840 --> 36:01.280
Hu.

911
36:01.280 --> 36:02.200
Hello, Xin.

912
36:02.400 --> 36:05.000
Something happened. Zhou Huan was taken away.

913
36:06.200 --> 36:07.260
Who was taken away?

914
36:07.360 --> 36:09.420
Zhou Huan was targeted by the police.

915
36:10.320 --> 36:11.380
For prostitution?

916
36:11.520 --> 36:13.250
No, I don't know what happened.

917
36:13.280 --> 36:14.320
We were having ginseng chicken soup.

918
36:14.320 --> 36:15.800
Then the police came and took him away.

919
36:15.800 --> 36:17.880
They said our company is suspected of fraud.

920
36:17.880 --> 36:19.560
They were going to take me away too.

921
36:19.560 --> 36:20.320
But I lied to them.

922
36:20.320 --> 36:21.240
I said I needed to go to the bathroom.

923
36:21.240 --> 36:23.040
So I had time to call you.

924
36:23.120 --> 36:25.080
Brother, you should go hide for a while.

925
36:25.080 --> 36:27.400
No, how could you two be...

926
36:27.640 --> 36:29.440
...targeted? What were you doing?

927
36:29.440 --> 36:29.960
Who are you calling?

928
36:29.960 --> 36:31.240
Brother, I have to go.

929
36:31.240 --> 36:32.240
Good luck.

930
36:32.320 --> 36:33.040
Come out.

931
36:36.040 --> 36:36.960
Officer.

932
36:37.560 --> 36:39.090
I have something to report.

933
36:50.880 --> 36:51.520
Hello.

934
36:51.880 --> 36:54.880
The number you dialed cannot be reached at the moment.

935
36:54.960 --> 36:56.480
Please try again later.

936
37:02.800 --> 37:04.240
Wang.

937
37:05.560 --> 37:06.280
Xin.

938
37:07.080 --> 37:08.040
Today.

939
37:08.400 --> 37:11.440
Don't transfer the last membership fee to the head office yet.

940
37:11.440 --> 37:13.480
There are some things that need to be checked.

941
37:13.480 --> 37:14.280
Okay, Xin.

942
37:14.760 --> 37:15.400
Go ahead.

943
37:18.600 --> 37:19.260
Loading...

944
37:20.160 --> 37:20.820
Loading...

945
37:24.040 --> 37:25.840
Public Security Network

946
37:30.760 --> 37:31.960
Captain Zhai, we just detected

947
37:31.960 --> 37:33.280
that the suspect bought a flight ticket to leave the country.

948
37:33.280 --> 37:34.740
The flight is in two hours.

949
37:35.080 --> 37:36.000
Officers,

950
37:36.000 --> 37:37.840
why have you been interrogating me for so long?

951
37:37.840 --> 37:39.170
Have you caught Jia Xin?

952
37:39.480 --> 37:41.740
We are the ones asking the questions now.

953
37:42.040 --> 37:44.560
Why are you asking me? I'm an undercover agent.

954
37:44.560 --> 37:45.880
We are family,

955
37:45.880 --> 37:46.880
comrades.

956
37:47.080 --> 37:47.800
Officer,

957
37:48.960 --> 37:50.240
can I go now?

958
37:50.520 --> 37:51.600
My phone is broken,

959
37:51.600 --> 37:53.240
but I... I'll just let it go.

960
37:53.400 --> 37:54.860
You can't leave right now.

961
37:56.240 --> 37:58.880
I've explained everything clearly.

962
37:59.120 --> 38:00.680
He smashed my Pro first

963
38:01.000 --> 38:02.280
and scratched me all over.

964
38:02.280 --> 38:03.280
I'm the victim.

965
38:08.760 --> 38:10.160
You are Zhou Huan, right?

966
38:10.240 --> 38:12.400
We need to ask you a few questions.

967
38:27.640 --> 38:28.720
Xin, get in the car.

968
38:35.440 --> 38:36.560
Stop! Don't run!

969
38:38.440 --> 38:39.120
Stop! Freeze!

970
38:39.120 --> 38:39.720
Hurry!

971
38:39.720 --> 38:40.240
Stop!

972
38:40.520 --> 38:41.450
Freeze! Freeze!

973
38:41.880 --> 38:43.400
Handcuff him. Get in the car. Let's go.

974
38:43.400 --> 38:45.000
Take him away. Take him away.

975
38:45.240 --> 38:45.840
Go, go, go.

976
38:46.840 --> 38:47.640
Get in the car.

977
38:49.480 --> 38:51.800
Attorney Xiao, on behalf of the team, thank you

978
38:51.800 --> 38:53.840
for calling the police in time and assisting us.

979
38:53.840 --> 38:55.200
But don't do this again.

980
38:55.400 --> 38:56.240
It's too risky.

981
38:56.240 --> 38:57.520
I'm sorry, Captain Zhai.

982
38:57.520 --> 38:59.320
I'll be more careful from now on.

983
39:01.320 --> 39:03.160
Thank you for supporting our work.

984
39:03.160 --> 39:05.040
It's my duty. The police and the people are one family.

985
39:05.040 --> 39:05.400
Okay.

986
39:05.400 --> 39:06.440
If there are any problems in the future,

987
39:06.440 --> 39:07.480
we will contact you again.

988
39:07.480 --> 39:09.160
Okay, just let me know if you need anything.

989
39:09.160 --> 39:09.440
Okay.

990
39:09.440 --> 39:09.880
Okay, okay.

991
39:09.880 --> 39:11.340
Goodbye. Get back to work.

992
39:11.720 --> 39:14.120
Working so late. Thanks for your hard work.

993
39:27.000 --> 39:27.930
You betrayed me!

994
39:29.800 --> 39:31.040
I'll get you!

995
39:31.040 --> 39:32.040
Behave yourself.

996
39:34.920 --> 39:36.200
That's so satisfying.

997
39:36.360 --> 39:38.960
How is it? Brother Hu is out.

998
39:38.960 --> 39:40.320
What do you mean 'released'?

999
39:40.320 --> 39:42.320
The police officers escorted me out.

1000
39:42.320 --> 39:44.480
Yes, you wielded the sword of justice this time.

1001
39:44.480 --> 39:45.880
You made a great contribution.

1002
39:45.880 --> 39:46.920
Of course.

1003
39:46.920 --> 39:48.720
You didn't see Jia Xin's expression just now.

1004
39:48.720 --> 39:49.520
It was so funny.

1005
39:49.520 --> 39:50.200
Really?

1006
39:51.600 --> 39:54.040
Let me have a laugh too. Come on.

1007
39:55.920 --> 39:57.080
I was a little touched just now.

1008
39:57.080 --> 39:59.410
I thought you came specially to pick me up.

1009
40:01.320 --> 40:02.120
Thank you.

1010
40:02.280 --> 40:03.210
You're welcome.

1011
40:18.720 --> 40:20.040
Didn't we agree on your rehab session?

1012
40:20.040 --> 40:21.570
Why did you cancel it again?

1013
40:22.040 --> 40:23.500
I've been too busy lately.

1014
40:23.880 --> 40:26.280
Pushing through during a flare-up will only make it worse.

1015
40:26.280 --> 40:29.480
You have to make time to come in, no matter how busy you are.

1016
40:32.480 --> 40:34.920
I'm talking to you. Are you listening?

1017
40:36.360 --> 40:37.840
Cheng Fei, I have to go now.

1018
40:52.840 --> 40:55.200
I'm pretty annoying, huh? We meet again.

1019
40:56.120 --> 40:58.320
Ms. Xiao, I know you mean well.

1020
41:00.160 --> 41:01.420
At least you know that.

1021
41:02.240 --> 41:03.040
Today

1022
41:03.040 --> 41:05.280
is the tenth day since your verdict was handed down.

1023
41:05.280 --> 41:07.760
I have a bad habit.

1024
41:08.840 --> 41:11.520
I never give up until the very last moment.

1025
41:14.840 --> 41:15.640
I know

1026
41:15.840 --> 41:17.480
you trust Zhou Huan so much

1027
41:17.600 --> 41:18.720
because of this

1028
41:18.720 --> 41:21.320
overseas insurance policy worth 1.2 million,

1029
41:21.840 --> 41:22.520
right?

1030
41:22.880 --> 41:24.080
How did you know?

1031
41:24.200 --> 41:27.240
Because he bought one for his new wife too,

1032
41:27.440 --> 41:28.760
which gave him away.

1033
41:29.000 --> 41:29.960
I found out.

1034
41:31.320 --> 41:33.320
Impossible.

1035
41:33.880 --> 41:35.560
His new wife is just like you,

1036
41:35.720 --> 41:37.650
a tool for his self-preservation.

1037
41:38.760 --> 41:39.960
Unfortunately,

1038
41:40.400 --> 41:42.720
both of your policies are fake.

1039
41:44.600 --> 41:46.960
This is the email the insurance company sent me.

1040
41:46.960 --> 41:49.400
It proves that the real policy number

1041
41:49.400 --> 41:51.060
has one more digit than yours.

1042
41:52.040 --> 41:52.880
Take a look.

1043
41:52.960 --> 41:53.690
I won't look.

1044
41:54.120 --> 41:56.250
You got a piece of paper from somewhere

1045
41:56.320 --> 41:57.600
and claim it's fake?

1046
41:58.040 --> 41:59.640
And what's this about a wife?

1047
42:00.200 --> 42:01.640
Why should I believe you?

1048
42:04.360 --> 42:05.360
Don't believe me.

1049
42:07.720 --> 42:09.840
Here, listen to this.

1050
42:10.880 --> 42:12.080
You really love Lili.

1051
42:12.080 --> 42:13.120
Of course.

1052
42:13.640 --> 42:14.520
Let me tell you.

1053
42:15.440 --> 42:17.800
From the first moment I saw Lili,

1054
42:18.080 --> 42:19.080
I knew

1055
42:19.200 --> 42:22.160
she was the one I've been waiting for.

1056
42:22.160 --> 42:23.360
The right one.

1057
42:23.840 --> 42:25.400
Then you should marry her.

1058
42:25.760 --> 42:27.240
I won't marry anyone but her.

1059
42:27.240 --> 42:30.370
You have no chance. I will love her for the rest of my life.

1060
42:31.280 --> 42:32.160
What are you doing?

1061
42:32.160 --> 42:33.620
Do not play the recording.

1062
42:34.360 --> 42:35.280
Yu Huihui.

1063
42:36.360 --> 42:38.000
You need to wake up.

1064
42:38.960 --> 42:40.160
Meeting terminated.

1065
42:40.520 --> 42:41.050
Let's go.

1066
42:45.040 --> 42:46.720
Lawyer Xiao, I want to appeal.

1067
42:47.080 --> 42:48.920
Lawyer Xiao, I want to appeal.

1068
42:48.960 --> 42:50.440
I want to appeal.

1069
42:51.360 --> 42:52.920
I understand.

1070
42:53.560 --> 42:55.080
Let me appeal.
